==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[group]] of [[people]] ([[sleeper]]s) who [[inconspicuously]] remain [[dormant]] in a [[community]] until [[activated]], by a [[prearranged]] [[signal]], [[in order to]] [[perform]] [[act]]s of [[espionage]], [[sabotage]], or [[terrorism]].

